This repository contains a Jupyter notebook that configures and runs vLLM
(https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

The notebook serves nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-Nano-9B-v2-NVFP4 and installs
prebuilt wheels from the Hugging Face dataset
mgschwind/fleetwide-nvfp4-t4-wheelhouse. Both carry their own licenses and
neither is redistributed here.

This is a proof of concept and not a supported configuration.
